{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372440/extras/85553a78554fb57b553d93474a46914b.avif?t=1748960067\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372440/extras_big/85553a78554fb57b553d93474a46914b.avif?t=1748960067 width=800 height=123 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>MEOWWWWWWWWW!!!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Opening your eyes you feel the dampness of a deep cave, and memories jumble in your head. As you gather your thoughts, fear and the horror of loss overtake you. Your favorite cat has been stolen! Now you have to get to the top to save him, but it won't be easy at all</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372440/extras/eef80ada912850c7bf4979cc0a6e8706.poster.avif?t=1748960067\" width=800 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372440/extras/eef80ada912850c7bf4979cc0a6e8706.webm?t=1748960067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372440/extras/eef80ada912850c7bf4979cc0a6e8706.mp4?t=1748960067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372440/extras/79c2602172cc923fc24a12a0811bbe7f.avif?t=1748960067\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372440/extras_big/79c2602172cc923fc24a12a0811bbe7f.avif?t=1748960067 width=800 height=123 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Be prepared for a tough challenge!</strong><br><br><strong>- Hold down the button to increase the teleportation range, release it to teleport!</strong><br>It will take time to master the skill of teleportation ... and a wall or two<br><br><strong>- Use the buttons to change the teleportation direction!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Checkpoints will help you resurrect after hitting a wall, but they will break if you fall too low!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372440/extras/998da08b5a1df22521734094bc0cb5b7.poster.avif?t=1748960067\" width=800 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372440/extras/998da08b5a1df22521734094bc0cb5b7.webm?t=1748960067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372440/extras/998da08b5a1df22521734094bc0cb5b7.mp4?t=1748960067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The higher you climb, the easier it will be to fall down</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the complex skill of teleportation to perfection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your progress is automatically saved whether you succeed or fall</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your friends and community to prove your strength and resilience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372440/extras/93fbe05a4e8c95ca705b8dbdf127fbee.poster.avif?t=1748960067\" width=800 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372440/extras/93fbe05a4e8c95ca705b8dbdf127fbee.webm?t=1748960067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372440/extras/93fbe05a4e8c95ca705b8dbdf127fbee.mp4?t=1748960067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372440/extras/8e520660229a804e6e140172441536b8.avif?t=1748960067\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372440/extras_big/8e520660229a804e6e140172441536b8.avif?t=1748960067 width=800 height=123 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a mysterious magical world full of new creatures and obstacles, but be prepared for the dangers that await you along the way.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful pixel graphics and animation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Picturesque backgrounds and elaborate environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interesting characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dimensional sound and mesmerizing music</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372440/extras/b699fd1776f17408bbdc0af3f5c3176f.poster.avif?t=1748960067\" width=800 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372440/extras/b699fd1776f17408bbdc0af3f5c3176f.webm?t=1748960067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372440/extras/b699fd1776f17408bbdc0af3f5c3176f.mp4?t=1748960067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Positive character","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3372440/716f079a1d5a8